# Gateway caller check

Check the caller on every root field. Do not skip introspection, a named field, or subscriptions.

Nested selections (`Path.Length != 1`) are the same operation; do not check them again.

```csharp
if (context.Path.Length != 1)
{
    await next(context);
    return;
}

var userId = currentUserAccessor.CurrentUserId?.ToString()
    ?? throw new UnauthenticatedError("Пользователь не авторизован");
```
